      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAKOTA RYLEN (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.75 beating Care Factor. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Can make it two on the bounce. JAZZY HOPE (8) finished in the minors last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 530m at this track, taking a Grade 5/6 in a blistering 30.48. Must include on winning run two back. VICTA SPENCER (7) has recorded back to back wins, the quickest two back at Murray Bridge in 25.37. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Sure to measure up. SHE'S A JUMBO (4) is worth including after a top-three finish after leading most recently.",
